{
  "_comment": [
    "Machine inventory for the OneBoot release-verification pipeline.",
    "Copy to inventory.json (git-ignored) and edit.",
    "",
    "driver=oneboot (default): physical lab machines; needs source + mac + BMC",
    "  (or --trigger manual) + optional ssh for result pull.",
    "driver=vm: local QEMU/KVM; needs source + boot_style, and a KVM host of the",
    "  matching architecture (x86_64 targets on x86_64, ARM64 on arm64).",
    "",
    "Per-target fields:",
    "  name        unique label (used in artifact/report names)",
    "  source      OneBoot source id (see `oneboot_client.py sources`)",
    "  boot_style  redhat (anaconda) | casper (Ubuntu autoinstall)",
    "  artifact    which release target runs here, i.e. the tarball suffix:",
    "              x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu / aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu",
    "  frames      injected frames for the capture check (default 2000)",
    "  mac/bmc/ssh physical driver only",
    "  vm          VM driver only: {cpus, mem, disk, iso, dist_host}",
    "  dist_host   override the OneBoot distribution host (default 10.40.1.254)"
  ],
  "oneboot": "https://oneboot.netisdev.com",
  "targets": [
    {
      "name": "centos7-x86_64",
      "source": "centos_7_9_x86_64_dvd_2009",
